@FileUpload.API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5199

### Upload a photo (multipart form file named "file")
POST {{FileUpload.API_HostAddress}}/api/UploadPhoto/Upload/Photo?employeeId=1
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----boundary

------boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="test.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./test.jpg
------boundary--

###

### Retrieve a photo by id
GET {{FileUpload.API_HostAddress}}/api/UploadPhoto/Photo/1

###

### Delete a photo by id
DELETE {{FileUpload.API_HostAddress}}/api/UploadPhoto/Photo/1

###
